OL,3,GEast
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA cloudy and rather windy
OL,6,Fstart, with a blustery band of rain,
OL,7,Flocally heavy, moving eastwards
OL,8,Fthrough the morning, clearing East
OL,9,FAnglia by early afternoon. Sunny
OL,10,Fspells will then develop, though it
OL,11,Fwill remain breezy and feel mild.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FPlenty of clear skies
OL,14,Fovernight. Breezy at first, but winds
OL,15,Fwill soon ease and become light.
OL,16,FTurning chilly by dawn, with a few
OL,17,Fpatches of mist and fog possible.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
