OL,3,GEast
OL,4,
OL,5,CWednesday:FA chilly and bright start
OL,6,Fto Wednesday, with some cloud
OL,7,Fdeveloping during the afternoon.
OL,8,FRemaining dry throughout, with winds
OL,9,Fmostly light, though freshening
OL,10,Fslightly during the afternoon.
OL,11,
OL,12,COutlook for Thursday to Saturday:
OL,13,FCloudy and mild Thursday, with rain
OL,14,Farriving overnight. Brighter on Friday
OL,15,Fwith sunny spells and showers, before
OL,16,Fshowers become largely confined to
OL,17,Feastern areas on Saturday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
